WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.167
AMELIA REARDON:
Can I tell you a secret?

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:04.169
I used to be something
of a mess.

00:00:04.803 --> 00:00:07.607
That might be
the least surprising thing
I've ever heard.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:09.642
♪ (MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:13.213
She needs help, doesn't she?

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:14.680
<i> Julie.</i>

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:17.017
ROLAND WEST:
<i> Everything pointed
 to her being dead.</i>

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:20.120
<i> We were wrong.</i>

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:21.320
Find the girl...

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:23.389
<i> we get the story
 of what happened.</i>

00:00:24.089 --> 00:00:26.592
DETECTIVE HAYS:
<i>Imagine we're not the only ones
 looking for him.</i>

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:28.294
What happened out there?

00:00:30.195 --> 00:00:32.799
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:37.170
I know you. I know what you did.

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.540
I remember what we done,
and I remember not to say.

00:00:43.475 --> 00:00:46.146
DETECTIVE HAYS:
<i> Tired of the state
 being in our lives.</i>

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.115
<i> I wanna know the whole story.</i>

